{
  "id": "2CH.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Damanyoojiga 10",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eemoojiga mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida diyeada nisidiischi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa Rehoboamu Shekemu, aba gideaba fuga sean bea Israeli nupka Shekemu goombiit niny ghoah sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiiy ng'asheanji Yeroboamooda was orjeeda Nebati (aba damandida gwanda Misri aba gideaba gamng'awa madeeda sugoocheanda was Sulemani), ng'ata gabiikna Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geecheaksa eeguursa, ak Yeroboamu sea fuga sean bea Israeli ghapka ak gwayeesha Rehoboamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghweandaang'u ghayi ghwanung' gwadurumaniidi yookajeagaasa. Ak ghamneawa geemuscheey ahaasaasa gadiyoojiga hang'oonyi bea ghweandaang'u ea yookajeagaaschi durumani mida gheatkweakaasa, ak abeeda gajeegadiyeeseey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Abiikni gicha iing'ata eawooji samwagu.” Ng'ata ghang'eat ng'eat buuneeda gaweay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool sugoocheanda was Rehoboamu gweargweeda aba heeda gweargwa gea miineadayi aba madeeda Sulemani damanda gudu gwandeawa eaweega, ak gwayeesha, “Arukunean heapi gichea darukusa fiisu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa niny, “Inyas guwoosi doabiiwaat aba heedeaba fiisu, nea gihoosani saawa, nea gibalooli ng'asheega miyaas, abeeda gayghoah fugaagu bea gadiyeeda damanda manda muudeanooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoanaawa geaw girgweageeda adaw gweargwa, ak ghoang'waay girgweageeda gheareemanga hitiisa heeda sea niny nea gamiineadayi aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha saawa, “Gajarukunean ana girgweagi was dea jea darukusa fiisu eeniiseaniin ‘Geandeawaneasa yookajeega ghayi iin ghweandaang'u gheatkeakaasa’?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheareemanga hitiisa heeda sea niny gwayeesha niny, “Nih gichea rukusiina fuga eeshiineey, ‘Ghweandaang'u goodurumani yookajeagaasa, ak ang'iing'i giihasasi aba heedeanya’; ak abeeda gajeeshiina saawa, ‘Mooneedeanyu mwanang' aahaw ea gaburdeawa mananda ghweandeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa, ghweandeanyu inung' asareana yookajeega durumwana, abeeda aniini gaydeaheaneegwa yookeedeang'wa. Ghweandeanyu ghayi ghabwaraneegwa mughoowooda, ak aniini gaydabwaraneegwa udagilbajeega.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu Yeroboamu sea fuga sean heeda Rehoboamu eaweeteaba samwagu, gawuurji gida ghayi nyaashta sugoocheanda, “Abiikni heedeanyu eaweeteaba samwagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwasha sugoocheanda ghuusiga nyaawa aba nyarasta, nea ghwanaawa girgweageeda gweargwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata sugoocheanda was Rehoboamu goobalool saawa aba girgweageeda adaw gheareemanga, ak gwayeesha, “Ghweandeanyu ghayi ghoadurumwaan yookajeegeagwa, ak aniini gaydeaheaneegwa muuchi; ghweandeanyu niny ghayi ghabwaraneegwa mughoowooda, ak aniini gaydabwaraneegwa udagilbajeega.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak sugoocheanda ea mooleeysiina iita buuneeda, aba gideaba ng'asheanji gwaleabu heeda ASEETA gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gayghwahidu ng'asheandaanyi ghayi rukuna ghuuta Ahiya bea eemeeda Shiloni rukusa Yeroboamooda was orjeeda Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gwajeeng'u fuga Israeli gideaba sugoocheanda mooleeysiina iita saawa, hean goobalool saawa sugoocheanda, nea gwayeesha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
